   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "SK_StylePreset"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "A single apartment tower for a side-scrolling game, drawn as crisp pixel art.\n\nThe building is seen strictly from the front at eye level: a flat elevation view with no\nperspective and no isometric angle. The top surface of the roof is not visible, only the front\nwall and the roofline above it. The side walls are not visible either.\n\nTwelve storeys, rounded corner, blank walls, rooftop terrace with railings and a small shed.\n\nThe facade is deep indigo blue, lit softly from the left. There is no black outline around the\nbuilding. The tower stands centred with a wide margin of flat solid green on all four sides.",
    "environment / background",
    "z_image (pixel LoRA)",
    96,
    192,
    48,
    "green",
    1536,
    ""
   ],
